#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000000
msgid ""
"Professor Gálvez comes from \n"
"Costa Rica's University for Peace."
msgstr "加尔维斯教授来自\n哥斯达黎加和平大学。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000001
msgid "You see, over the past year,"
msgstr "你看，过去一年里，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000002
msgid ""
"there have been sightings of \n"
"an armed group in Costa Rica."
msgstr "哥斯达黎加有人目击到\n一支武装团体。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000003
msgid "They're not ours, of course."
msgstr "他们当然不是我们的人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000004
msgid "Costa Rica doesn't have an army."
msgstr "哥斯达黎加没有军队。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000005
msgid "Correct."
msgstr "对。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000006
msgid "Article 12 of our constitution states that"
msgstr "我国宪法第12条规定"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000007
msgid ""
"\"the Army as a permanent institution\n"
"is abolished.\""
msgstr "\"军队作为常设机构\n已被废除。\""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000008
msgid "The peace constitution..."
msgstr "和平宪法……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000000
msgid ""
"My name is Paz, and I will do anything\n"
"to protect my namesake. "
msgstr "我叫Paz，我会不惜一切\n保护我的同名者。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000001
msgid "It is my one and only purpose."
msgstr "这是我唯一的目的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000002
msgid ""
"Please... get them out of my country... \n"
"Make them leave Costa Rica. "
msgstr "求你了……让他们离开我的国家……\n让他们离开哥斯达黎加。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000003
msgid "Sorry, kid... "
msgstr "抱歉，孩子……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000004
msgid ""
"We know who you are, Big Boss.\n"
"That is why we've come to you."
msgstr "我们知道你是谁，Big Boss。\n这就是我们来找你的原因。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325df5/0x000000
msgid "Here."
msgstr "拿着。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325df5/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005c
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "谢谢。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000000
msgid "Lies, obviously."
msgstr "显然是谎言。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000001
msgid ""
"They're bringing in state-of-the-art \n"
"weaponry and equipment by the shipload."
msgstr "他们正用船运来最先进的\n武器和装备。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000002
msgid "Where'd they get that kind of cash?"
msgstr "他们哪来那么多钱？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000003
msgid "...I fear la CIA may be involved."
msgstr "……我担心CIA有份。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000004
msgid "The CIA?"
msgstr "CIA？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000005
msgid ""
"As you both know, the United States views\n"
"Central America as its backyard..."
msgstr "你们都知道，美国把\n中美洲视为自家后院……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000006
msgid ""
"Even after Cuba, we've managed to\n"
"maintain a delicate balance with the U.S."
msgstr "即使在古巴之后，我们仍设法\n与美国维持着微妙的平衡。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000007
msgid ""
"And your government\n"
"can't just give 'em the boot?"
msgstr "而你们的政府\n就不能直接把他们赶走吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000008
msgid "We are not allowed to bear arms."
msgstr "我们不许持武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000009
msgid ""
"Japan's constitution has something \n"
"similar... Article 9."
msgstr "日本宪法也有\n类似的内容……第九条。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000a
msgid ""
"It says Japan renounces war,\n"
"and can't maintain an army."
msgstr "它规定日本放弃战争，\n不能维持军队。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000b
msgid ""
"I understand that you and your men have\n"
"neither state nor ideology."
msgstr "我明白你和你的手下\n既无国家也无意识形态。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000c
msgid "...That you will fight any foe."
msgstr "……你们会与任何敌人作战。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000d
msgid ""
"Please, you must drive them out of \n"
"our defenseless country."
msgstr "求求你，把他们赶出我们\n这个毫无防备的国家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000e
msgid ""
"We come to you, \n"
"the Militaires San Frontières."
msgstr "我们来找你们，\n边境无国界军。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000000
msgid "So, you want to hire us?"
msgstr "你们想雇我们？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000001
msgid "Yes. As our deterrent."
msgstr "是的。作为我们的威慑力量。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000002
msgid "...We can't afford to pay much, it's true."
msgstr "……我们确实付不起多少钱。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000003
msgid "But,"
msgstr "但是，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000004
msgid ""
"we can offer you this, \n"
"a forward operating base."
msgstr "我们可以给你这个，\n一座前进作战基地。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000005
msgid "... an offshore plant in the Caribbean."
msgstr "……加勒比的一座海上工厂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000006
msgid "Sounds pretty good to me."
msgstr "听起来挺不错。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000007
msgid "This place is becoming a mess anyway."
msgstr "反正这地方越来越乱了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000008
msgid ""
"Snake, we need someplace \n"
"we can settle down. "
msgstr "SNAKE，我们需要个\n能安顿的地方。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000009
msgid ""
"The government's agreed to cooperate \n"
"... unofficially, of course."
msgstr "政府已同意合作\n……当然，是非官方的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000a
msgid "A chopper for transport'd be nice, too. "
msgstr "再来架运输直升机就更好了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000b
msgid "...I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "……我尽量想办法。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000d
msgid ""
"You seem to think we're just a pack \n"
"of \"dogs of war.\" Is that right? "
msgstr "你似乎觉得我们只是一群\n“战争野狗”。是吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000e
msgid ""
"Yes, that's what I've heard. \n"
"You're an army without a state... "
msgstr "是的，我听说了。\n你们是无国之军……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000f
msgid "No... We've only left our countries behind."
msgstr "不……我们只是离开了祖国。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000010
msgid "Please! You must help us!"
msgstr "求求你！你一定要帮我们！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000011
msgid ""
"If your suspicions are true,\n"
"force isn't gonna do any good."
msgstr "若你的怀疑属实，\n武力解决不了问题。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000012
msgid "You'll have to find a political solution."
msgstr "你得寻求政治解决。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000013
msgid "The government's hands are tied!"
msgstr "政府已经束手无策了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000014
msgid "Go back to your bosses in San José."
msgstr "回去找圣何塞的上司吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000015
msgid ""
"Tell them if they want, \n"
"I'll introduce them to a negotiator I know."
msgstr "告诉他们，愿意的话，\n我介绍个认识的谈判专家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000016
msgid "No,"
msgstr "不，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000017
msgid "I'm not here on their behalf."
msgstr "我不是代表他们来的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000018
msgid "So what are you doing here?"
msgstr "那你来这做什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000019
msgid ""
"For over twenty years, I've preached \n"
"the virtues of peace at multiple universities."
msgstr "二十多年来，我在多所大学\n宣讲和平之道。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00001a
msgid ""
"Tonight, I stand before \n"
"you as an educator. "
msgstr "今晚，我以教育者的身份\n站在各位面前。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000000
msgid ""
"They've got a supply port north of Puerto\n"
"Limon, a town en la costa del mar Caribe."
msgstr ""
"他们在利蒙港以北有一处补给港，\n"
"那是加勒比海沿岸的一座小镇。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000001
msgid ""
"A few days ago, Paz stumbled upon that \n"
"facility while searching for a lost friend. "
msgstr ""
"几天前，帕兹为了寻找失踪的朋友，\n"
"偶然撞见了那处设施。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000002
msgid "She was captured."
msgstr "她被抓了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000003
msgid "She's only a child... sixteen years old. "
msgstr "她只是个孩子……才十六岁。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000004
msgid ""
"They did... terrible things to her. \n"
"But somehow she managed to escape. "
msgstr ""
"他们对她……做了很可怕的事。\n"
"可她还是想办法逃了出来。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000005
msgid "My God..."
msgstr "我的天……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000006
msgid ""
"She's huerfana. \n"
"Her mother died when she was small,"
msgstr ""
"她是个孤儿。\n"
"母亲在她很小的时候就去世了，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000007
msgid ""
"and she lost her grandparents \n"
"in the civil war."
msgstr ""
"祖父母也\n"
"在内战中离开了她。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000008
msgid "She hates war with a passion like no other. "
msgstr "她对战争的憎恨，比任何人都强烈。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000000
msgid ""
"This is my student.\n"
"She came to me to study peace. "
msgstr ""
"这是我的学生。\n"
"她来我这里学习和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000001
msgid "Her name is Paz. Paz Ortega."
msgstr "她叫帕兹。帕兹·奥特加。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000002
msgid "Paz...? \"Peace?\""
msgstr "帕兹……？“和平”吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000003
msgid "No kidding? That's my name, too."
msgstr "不开玩笑？我的名字也是这个意思。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000004
msgid "Kazuhira... it's Japanese for \"peace.\" "
msgstr "Kazuhira……在日语里就是“和平”的意思。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000005
msgid "Pleased to meet you, Paz. Call me Kaz. "
msgstr "很高兴认识你，帕兹。叫我卡兹就好。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000000
msgid ""
"You think it's rebels\n"
"who've fled Nicaragua?"
msgstr "你以为这些是从尼加拉瓜\n逃出的叛军？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000001
msgid ""
"No no...They don't appear to be guerillas. \n"
"They're far too organized."
msgstr "不不……他们不像是游击队。\n组织性太强了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000002
msgid "What's your government's take?"
msgstr "你们政府怎么看？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000003
msgid ""
"The authorities in San José claim \n"
"it's a multinational security firm"
msgstr "圣何塞当局声称\n这是一家跨国安保公司"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000004
msgid ""
"hired by the Development Corporation \n"
"of Costa Rica."
msgstr "受雇于哥斯达黎加\n开发公司。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x925df8/0x000000
msgid ""
"I feel like a new man!\n"
"There's no coffee like Costa Rican coffee."
msgstr "我感觉焕然一新！\n哥斯达黎加咖啡无与伦比。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x925df8/0x000001
msgid ""
"So, what brings a distinguished scholar from\n"
"the Costa Rican government to Colombia?"
msgstr "那么，是什么让哥斯达黎加政府的\n杰出学者来到哥伦比亚？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000000
msgid "What's going on, Kaz?"
msgstr "怎么了，卡兹？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000001
msgid "We've got guests."
msgstr "有客人来。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000002
msgid "Time to move?"
msgstr "该走了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000003
msgid ""
"Don't worry.\n"
"It's not our friends from Langley."
msgstr "别担心。\n不是兰利那帮朋友。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000004
msgid ""
"I brought 'em.\n"
"Made sure we weren't followed."
msgstr "是我带他们来。\n确认没被跟踪。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000005
msgid "Thank you, Big Boss!"
msgstr "谢谢你，BIG BOSS！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000006
msgid "Call me Snake."
msgstr "叫我SNAKE。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000007
msgid "Oh, uh, sorry... Vic Boss!"
msgstr "哦，呃，抱歉……Vic Boss！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000008
msgid "Listen up. For us, there is no victory."
msgstr "听好了。对我们来说，没有胜利。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000009
msgid "But in revolution, doesn't one triumph or die?"
msgstr "但革命中，不成功便成仁吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x00000a
msgid "We don't do either."
msgstr "我们也不做。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000000
msgid "Are they still here?"
msgstr "他们还在这？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000001
msgid "C'mon, Snake. This could be good for us."
msgstr "来吧，SNAKE。这对我们有利。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000002
msgid "They're willing to give us an offshore plant "
msgstr "他们愿意给我们一座海上工厂，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000003
msgid ""
"a place we can finally put down some roots. \n"
"This is our chance to expand MSF."
msgstr "一个终于能扎根的地方。\n这是我们扩张MSF的机会。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000004
msgid "We don't need a place to stay, Kaz. "
msgstr "我们不需要落脚点，卡兹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000005
msgid "We're nomads, we always will be."
msgstr "我们是游牧者，永远都是。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000006
msgid ""
"What, you'd rather keep wandering \n"
"from conflict to conflict,"
msgstr "怎么，你宁愿游走于\n一场场冲突间，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000007
msgid ""
"tools in the hands of whoever's \n"
"fighting at the time?"
msgstr "充当当时开战者的\n手中工具？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000008
msgid ""
"The second we settle down, who's to say\n"
"we won't become the warmongers?"
msgstr "我们一旦安顿下来，谁敢说\n我们不会变成好战者？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000009
msgid ""
"Listen to me, Snake. We're not mercenaries.\n"
"We're not a foreign legion. "
msgstr "听我说，SNAKE。我们不是雇佣兵。\n我们不是外籍军团。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000a
msgid "MSF's a business. A new kind of business."
msgstr "MSF是门生意。一种新型生意。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000b
msgid "Look, it's not like we're trying to start a war here. "
msgstr "听着，我们又不是想在这里挑起战争。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000c
msgid ""
"All we need to do is find out who this\n"
"\"security company\" really is."
msgstr "我们要做的只是查清这家\n“保安公司”到底是谁。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000d
msgid ""
"C'mon, Kaz... It's pretty obvious that \n"
"they're backed by the CIA."
msgstr "得了吧，卡兹……很明显\n他们背后是CIA。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000e
msgid "Wait a sec. That would mean..."
msgstr "等等。那岂不是说……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000f
msgid "Our friend the \"professor\"... is likely KGB."
msgstr "我们那位“教授”朋友……很可能属于克格勃。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000010
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000058
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "原来如此……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000011
msgid "...We'd be making an enemy of our homeland."
msgstr "……我们就将与祖国为敌。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000012
msgid "And there'd be no turning back..."
msgstr "而且再无回头路……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000013
msgid "...This damned thing won't light."
msgstr "……这鬼东西点不着。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000014
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000038
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000004
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00006b
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "嗯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000015
msgid ""
"Put on some coffee, Kaz.\n"
"It's time for a little chat with the \"professor.\""
msgstr "煮点咖啡，卡兹。\n该跟“教授”聊聊了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000016
msgid "I was a heavy smoker. "
msgstr "我以前烟瘾很重。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000017
msgid "When I got my medal from the Secretary General, "
msgstr "当秘书长给我颁发勋章时，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000018
msgid "he gave me this prosthetic hand as well..."
msgstr "他也给了我这只假手……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000019
msgid ""
"But smoking was ruining my lungs, so I quit.\n"
"I've not had much use for it since."
msgstr "但抽烟毁了我的肺，所以我戒了。\n从那以后就很少用上它。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001a
msgid ""
"It's quite an honor to meet \n"
"the legendary Big Boss."
msgstr "能见到传奇BIG BOSS，\n真是荣幸。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001b
msgid "That's just a code name the CIA made up."
msgstr "那只是CIA编出来的代号。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001c
msgid "Then perhaps I should call you John?"
msgstr "那么也许我该叫你约翰？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001d
msgid "I don't have a name. "
msgstr "我没有名字。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001e
msgid ""
"Stopped using that code name you \n"
"like so much ten years ago."
msgstr "十年前就不再使用你\n喜欢的那个代号了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001f
msgid ""
"...What about you, comrade?\n"
"What do they call you back at Tsentr?"
msgstr "……你呢，同志？\n在中央局他们怎么称呼你？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000020
msgid "Well, then, allow me to get straight to the point."
msgstr "那么，我就直入正题了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000021
msgid "\"Land as slim as a whip, hot as torture.\""
msgstr "“土地细如鞭，酷热如刑。”"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000022
msgid "That's the Chilean poet, Neruda... "
msgstr "智利诗人聂鲁达……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000023
msgid ""
"Central America is the navel\n"
"of the American continents, "
msgstr "中美洲是美洲大陆的\n肚脐，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000024
msgid "bridging North and South."
msgstr "连接着南北两方。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000025
msgid "We want this land."
msgstr "我们想要这片土地。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000026
msgid ""
"We'll build a socialist stronghold, \n"
"then use it to split the Americas in two."
msgstr "我们要建立社会主义据点，\n再借此把美洲一分为二。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000027
msgid "America would lose its backyard."
msgstr "美国将失去它的后院。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000028
msgid ""
"And with it, its economic production, \n"
"shipping lanes, and strategic value."
msgstr "随之失去的还有经济生产、\n航运要道和战略价值。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000029
msgid "We, on the other hand, "
msgstr "而我们，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002a
msgid ""
"would gain a base from which all of Latin America\n"
"would be well within our reach."
msgstr "将获得一个基地，整个拉丁美洲\n都将尽在我们掌握之中。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002b
msgid ""
"He who controls Central America,\n"
"will win this Cold War."
msgstr "谁控制了中美洲，\n谁就能赢得这场冷战。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002c
msgid "First comes Nicaragua."
msgstr "先到尼加拉瓜。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002d
msgid "Toppling the pro-American Somoza regime."
msgstr "推翻亲美的索摩查政权。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002e
msgid ""
"In preparation, we've begun instigating\n"
"anti-Somoza sentiment "
msgstr "为此，我们已开始煽动\n反索摩查情绪，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002f
msgid ""
"and providing aid to the Sandinista \n"
"National Liberation Front."
msgstr "并向桑地诺\n民族解放阵线提供援助。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000030
msgid ""
"You're manipulating Sandinista into\n"
"overthrowing Somoza for you."
msgstr "你在操纵桑地诺派替你\n推翻索摩查。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000031
msgid ""
"After the revolution, \n"
"Nicaragua will become a socialist state."
msgstr "革命之后，\n尼加拉瓜将成为社会主义国家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000032
msgid "You think America's just gonna let that happen?"
msgstr "你觉得美国会坐视不管吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000033
msgid "Certainly not. After all, the CIA is already here."
msgstr "当然不会。毕竟，CIA已经在这里了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000034
msgid "And that's the armed group inside Costa Rica?"
msgstr "就是哥斯达黎加境内的那支武装？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000035
msgid ""
"Precisely. It's clear they've been sent in to \n"
"disrupt our efforts across the border,"
msgstr "正是。显然他们是被派来\n破坏我们跨境行动的，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000036
msgid "in Nicaragua."
msgstr "在尼加拉瓜。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000037
msgid ""
"Simply put, the army now stationed in \n"
"Costa Rica is CIA capital."
msgstr "简单说，驻\n哥斯达黎加军队就是CIA资金。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000038
msgid ""
"But it's more complex than that.\n"
"The CIA's got something else planned as well."
msgstr "但事情没那么简单。\nCIA还另有打算。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000039
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000097
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003b
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x16da5b/0x000000
#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00000c
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000038
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000049
msgid "What?"
msgstr "什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003a
msgid "That is the million dollar question."
msgstr "这正是关键所在。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003b
msgid ""
"Big Boss, we want you \n"
"and your unit to find the answer."
msgstr "BIG BOSS，希望你\n和部队找出答案。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003c
msgid ""
"Infiltrate and investigate the facility en la costa\n"
"where Paz was imprisoned. "
msgstr "潜入并调查帕兹曾被关押的\n海边设施。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003d
msgid ""
"Learn all you can of their operations.\n"
"Then, drive them out of the country."
msgstr "尽可能摸清他们的行动。\n然后把他们赶出这个国家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003e
msgid ""
"You're asking us to settle a turf war\n"
"between the KGB and the CIA?"
msgstr "你是要我们插手\n克格勃和CIA的地盘之争？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003f
msgid "...What about her? That was all just an act?"
msgstr "……那她呢？那些都只是演戏？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000040
msgid "Hmm. You mean her words about peace?"
msgstr "嗯。你是说她那些关于和平的话？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000041
msgid ""
"She was captured - that much is true.\n"
"But I've kept my KGB affiliation from her."
msgstr "她被俘了，这点真。\n但我没让她知道我是克格勃。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000042
msgid "And you thought we'd fall for a sob story?"
msgstr "你以为我们会信这种苦情戏？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000043
msgid "No, I had good reason to bring her along."
msgstr "不，我带她来有充分理由。"
